owner`, `admin`, `reviewer`, `viewer` |\n| `created_at` | TIMESTAMP | |\n\nUnique constraint:\n\n```text\norganization_id + user_id\n```\n\n## `playbooks`\n\nA playbook defines the organization’s review preferences.\n\n| Field | Type | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `id` | UUID | Primary key |\n| `organization_id` | UUID | Foreign key |\n| `name` | VARCHAR(255) | |\n| `description` | TEXT | |\n| `rules_json` | JSONB | Clause types, risk rules, preferred positions |\n| `is_default` | BOOLEAN | |\n| `created_by` | UUID | User ID |\n| `created_at` | TIMESTAMP | |\n| `updated_at` | TIMESTAMP | |\n\nExample `rules_json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"required_clauses\": [\n    \"confidentiality\",\n    \"limitation_of_liability\",\n    \"termination\",\n    \"governing_law\"\n  ],\n  \"risk_preferences\": {\n    \"uncapped_liability\": \"high\",\n    \"automatic_renewal\": \"medium\",\n    \"customer_indemnity\": \"high\",\n    \"payment_terms_over_60_days\": \"medium\"\n  },\n  \"preferred_positions\": {\n    \"payment_terms\": \"Net 30\",\n    \"liability_cap\": \"fees_paid_in_previous_12_months\",\n    \"governing_law\": \"New York\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## `documents`\n\n| Field | Type | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `id` | UUID | Primary key |\n| `organization_id` | UUID | Tenant ID |\n| `uploaded_by` | UUID | User ID |\n| `file_name` | VARCHAR(500) | |\n| `file_type` | VARCHAR(50) | `pdf`, `docx` |\n| `s3_key` | VARCHAR(1000) | Private object key |\n| `file_size_bytes` | BIGINT | |\n| `sha256_hash` | VARCHAR(64) | Duplicate detection |\n| `status` | VARCHAR(50) | `uploading`, `queued`, `processing`, `completed`, `failed` |\n| `processing_error` | TEXT | Nullable |\n| `page_count` | INTEGER | Nullable |\n| `selected_playbook_id` | UUID | Nullable |\n| `created_at` | TIMESTAMP | |\n| `updated_at` | TIMESTAMP | |\n| `completed_at` | TIMESTAMP | Nullable |\n\n## `document_pages`\n\n| Field | Type | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `id` | UUID | Primary key |\n| `document_id` | UUID | Foreign key |\n|